{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-1","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-109","text":"PULSE"}]},{"id":"blk-2","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-110","text":"Protocol for Uniform Loop State Exchange. Where [&] declares "},{"id":"spn-111","marks":["bold"],"text":"what"},{"id":"spn-112","text":" an agent is, PULSE declares "},{"id":"spn-113","marks":["bold"],"text":"when"},{"id":"spn-114","text":" its loops run. Every loop declares its phases, "},{"id":"spn-115","text":"cadence, substrates, invariants, and cross-loop connections in a single manifest file."}]},{"id":"blk-3","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-116","text":"The five canonical phases"}]},{"id":"blk-4","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-117","text":"The phase kinds match the memory loop exactly: "},{"id":"spn-118","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve · route · act · learn · consolidate"},{"id":"spn-119","text":". Cross-loop tokens flow between loops — including "},{"id":"spn-120","marks":["code"],"text":"SurpriseSignal"},{"id":"spn-121","text":", emitted on forward-model prediction error by the "},{"id":"spn-122","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-123","text":" primitive."}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-6","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-124","text":"The eight kernel rungs are not the five PULSE phases. The rungs govern what is allowed at a single decision point; PULSE describes when the loop runs."}]}],"id":"blk-5","kind":"quote"}],"edges":[{"object":"bend:dltx3b4","predicate":"ampersand.docs:part-of-stack","subject":"bend:d4hixla"},{"object":"bend:d4hgjw0","predicate":"ampersand.docs:measured-by","subject":"bend:d4hixla"},{"object":"https://github.com/c-u-l8er/PULSE","predicate":"cites","subject":"bend:d4hixla"}],"id":"bagaaierajqpirvxbqalvnsz6vbfhnh7tmdjmzacdllb3cw6hojkeja5xze5q","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.v1"}